# shield/oval: the Oval shield (polish i1, LADDER-HEAD, gen_oval.py; form6 = cult::ShieldForm::Oval, the Marsh's): a
# tall rounded board, the field painted (P) with a reed device (two leaves on a stalk, device slot), a rim (R); the back
# in leather boards (N) with two straps. Keys, layers, the lie and the back views follow the kite. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role shield form6
layer shield
anchor gripL
keys shield
tags overlay
legend R field 1
legend S field 2
legend T field 3
legend F device 2
legend J device 3

legend ( plume 0
legend < plume 1
legend > plume 2
legend ^ plume 3
legend ] metal2 4
legend [ metal2 0
legend ; leather 0
legend : leather 1
legend = leather 2
legend + leather 3

